  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TCPF: Support to the wheat seed production under seed village initiative to reduce the wheat-blast disease infestation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To develop a farmers-managed wheat blast-free seed system in Bangladesh following the Seed Village approach. It is expected that the result of the project will create awareness among the high-level policymakers to undertake a long-term project to promote high-quality wheat seeds, and donors will come forward to support the initiative.</narrative>
  </description>
